flowchart TD
    User([Client]) -->|GET /tenants/TENANT_ID/abstraction| API[abstraction.get_abstraction]
    API --> Build[build_abstraction]

    Build --> FetchTenant[Fetch Tenant + Property<br/>from DB]
    FetchTenant -->|not found| Err404[404 not found]

    FetchTenant --> FilterScope[Filter 72 fields by<br/>abstract_type × property_type<br/>from reference_data]

    FilterScope --> FetchDocs[Sort tenant.documents<br/>by document_order<br/>0 = base, 1..7 = amendments]

    FetchDocs --> IndexFV[Index tenant.field_values<br/>as field_id, doc_id → FieldValue]

    IndexFV --> LoadOverrides[Load FieldOverride rows<br/>for this tenant<br/>→ field_id → override]

    LoadOverrides --> FieldLoop{For each field in scope}

    FieldLoop --> BuildPerDoc[For each document:<br/>fetch FieldValue,<br/>assemble FieldValueOut<br/>value, confidence,<br/>page_number, clause_number,<br/>clause_text,<br/>condition_type_taken,<br/>red_flags, needs_review,<br/>trace_summary]

    BuildPerDoc --> BuildInputs[Build DocumentValueInputs<br/>one per doc,<br/>carrying value + confidence<br/>+ page + clause + clause_text]

    BuildInputs --> HasOverride{Override<br/>exists?}
    HasOverride -->|yes| UseOverride[concluded_value = override.value<br/>concluded_source = 'override'<br/>confidence = 1.0<br/>source_document_label = 'Override']
    HasOverride -->|no| FindAmend{Any amendment<br/>with real value?}

    FindAmend -->|yes| LatestAmend[Sort amendments by<br/>effective_date DESC<br/>take winner]
    LatestAmend --> UseAmend[concluded_value = amend.value<br/>concluded_source = 'amendment_N'<br/>confidence = amend.confidence<br/>page_number = amend.page<br/>clause_number = amend.clause<br/>clause_text = amend.clause_text<br/>source_document_id/label]

    FindAmend -->|no| FindBase{Base lease<br/>has value?}
    FindBase -->|yes| UseBase[concluded_value = base.value<br/>concluded_source = 'base_lease'<br/>confidence = base.confidence<br/>page_number / clause /<br/>clause_text all from base]

    FindBase -->|no| FindFallback{Any doc has<br/>clause_text<br/>as context?}
    FindFallback -->|yes| UseFallback[concluded_value = 'None'<br/>but page/clause/clause_text<br/>from best fallback doc<br/>confidence = 0.0]
    FindFallback -->|no| NoneResult[concluded_value = 'None'<br/>all citation fields null<br/>confidence = 0.0]

    UseOverride --> DeriveBand
    UseAmend --> DeriveBand
    UseBase --> DeriveBand
    UseFallback --> DeriveBand
    NoneResult --> DeriveBand

    DeriveBand[confidence_band:<br/>≥0.8 → high<br/>≥0.5 → medium<br/>>0 → low<br/>=0 → none]

    DeriveBand --> AppendField[Append AbstractedField<br/>to fields list]
    AppendField --> FieldLoop

    FieldLoop -->|all fields done| Summary[Build AbstractionSummary:<br/>total_fields<br/>fields_extracted<br/>fields_none<br/>fields_overridden<br/>fields_flagged_review<br/>mean_confidence<br/>high/medium/low counts]

    Summary --> Assemble[TenantAbstractionOut:<br/>tenant info, documents,<br/>fields array,<br/>summary block]

    Assemble -->|200 OK| Response([{<br/>  tenant_id,<br/>  fields: [{<br/>    concluded_value,<br/>    concluded_confidence: 0.92,<br/>    confidence_level: 'high',<br/>    source_document_label: 'Amendment 1',<br/>    page_number: 2,<br/>    clause_number: '5.1',<br/>    per_document: [...]<br/>  }],<br/>  summary: { mean_confidence: 0.83 }<br/>}])

    style User fill:#2d6cdf,color:#fff
    style Response fill:#2ea043,color:#fff
    style Err404 fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style UseOverride fill:#a855f7,color:#fff
    style UseAmend fill:#f97316,color:#fff
    style UseBase fill:#fbbf24,color:#000
    style Summary fill:#06b6d4,color:#fff
